        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-COSMO-SN\"><b>Laurey Cosmopolitan Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Nickel Cosmopolitan Cabinet Pull is available in a few sizes for small and large cabinet doors. The Cosmopolitan Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull comes packaged with the mounting hardware. The sleek design is great for modern kitchen remodels. And it is easy to care for!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Cosmopolitan Satin Nickel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-73028:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-3/4\" (96mm)</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73128:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5\" (128mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73228:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 6-1/4\" (160mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73328:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 7-1/2\" (192mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-73428:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 10\" (256mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
